# AI Indexing & Search Rules

# Ignore build artifacts and internal tool data
build/
.dart_tool/
.pub-cache/
.pub/

# Ignore platform-specific folders (usually not needed for logic/UI)
android/
ios/
linux/
macos/
windows/
web/

# Ignore large binary assets and logs
assets/
logs/
*.txt
*.log

# Ignore documentation that is already indexed in Knowledge Items
# project_roadmap_detailed.md
